JDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7pSBvJ2aaAiE2hpBnFVofWy0U6hXOcPrbX4NNO4_83yQ&oe=6A1C40A7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5.png", "id": "944345853839834", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001705_944345860506500_2243806541213045118_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l8TWYaB4Zu0Q7kNvwHRr3hG&_nc_oc=AdqD-7zloaqvL3v1G3CKHmJ6LMfYbGhk0ilhasBRUqERXRqx0I9OSntQiwe_jNxhvEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4cRBtvCMyrfiqShV9ZFCLTQntirHI2JW5xoFWv0-6yVw&oe=6A1C33DE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Otisdub Tag", "keywords": ["gorilla", "parkour", "BAwesome", "Otisclub", "fangame"], "long_description": "Otisdub Tag is a Gorilla Tag fan game made by Otisdub. It has many features, including:\n\n1. Three maps!\n2. Two cosmetics!\n3. A Rec Room remake! ^OtisdubTag by Stungspore\n\nAnd more!\n\n\n\nMap 1: Outdoors\nOutdoors is a fun map. The map is just some grass and trees, making it a good hangout spot. As the name implies, this is outside!\n\nMap 2: Cosmetics\nCosmetics is where you get the two cosmetics for the game. There is also a mirror in this map so you can look at your outfit!\n\nMap 3: Parkour (a.k.a. Only Up)\nThis is the very first map to ever exist in the game. As the name implies, it's just parkour.", "short_description": "Otisdub Tag is a Gorilla Tag fan game (NOT A COPY) made by Otisdub. It has many features, including:\n\n1. Three maps!\n2. Two cosmetics!\n3. A Rec Room remake! ^OtisdubTag by Stungspore\n\nAnd more!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://otisdub-tag.otisdub.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Otisclub", "support_website_url": "https://otisdub-tag.otisdub.com/support", "website_url": "https://otisdub-tag.otisdub.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "27